(52,14,'2026-09-04 10:32:00','2026-09-04','DWR BY TEDDY RCO,EMLIY RNO,CHRISTINE RNO\r\npatient doing day 7 post admission secondary to alzheimers disease with confusional state and refusal to feed with 2nd degree pressure sores,with HHD/AHA class 2\r\ntoday;nnc\r\no/e-patient has marked improovement,feeding well and retaining as from yesterday night but still on assisted feeding,taking in fluids adequately passsed stool in the night,drained 700mls of urine in the morning with fluid input of 1 litre in 24 hours,catheter in situ,\r\nvitals-BP-110/70 PR-70 SPO2-92 on room air\r\nplan\r\nct with meds as per t sheet\r\nfor discharge \r\nct with physiotherapy\r\nct with assisted feeding\r\nct monitoring the bps',7,'2026-09-04 07:41:18'),
(53,16,'2026-09-04 09:18:00','2026-09-07','Bizarre behaviour \r\nrestlessness\r\nhallucinations\r\naggressive behaviour\r\ndiziness\r\npatient who is a known  HTN patient for a long time(unknown duration)was brought in accompanied by the son and daughter with the above complains,daughter reports that the patient allegedly could stare at one place for long  time without with diziness and alot of regrets,patient allegedly stopped taking antihypertensive medicaation(amlodipine)relatives report that he was drunk on sunday,(on balozi and spirirts)before the bizarre behaviour started,but reports that if no alcohol is consumed patient usually is okay.also reports of dysponea on exertion worse when drunk.\r\nPAST MEDICAL AND SURGICAL HISTORY\r\n2ND admission\r\nno previous hx of any surgical procedures done \r\nprevious history of head ct scan ands echo done on 3/07/2026\r\nno previous hx of blood transfusion \r\nNKDFA\r\nSOCIAL ECONOMIC HX\r\nmarried with 5 living children all alive \r\nO/E-in fgc,calm,not aggressive\r\nG/E-no pallor,no cyanosis,no dehydration\r\nvitals-bp-175/125 pr-137\r\nROS-rs,cvs,cns-nad\r\nDX-ALCOHOL/SUBSTANCE ABUSE DISORDER/HYPERTENSIVE EMERGENCY/OTITIS MEDIA/URTI\r\nPLAN\r\np.o nifedipine 20mg sublingual stat\r\np.o furosemide 40mg stat\r\niv diazepam 10mg stat\r\np.o pabrinex 1&11 od *2/52\r\np.o neurobion 1 od *1/12\r\ntopical gentamycin ear drops 2 drops bd *5/7\r\np.o pcm 1 gm ts *3/7\r\np.o tricohist cough syrup 10mls tds *5/7',7,'2026-09-07 06:34:29'),
(54,16,'2026-09-05 10:47:00','2026-09-05','patient admitted with alcohol abuse disorder,previous admission 3/12 ago,with same problem,was councelled but rersumed taking alcohol a while back,defaulted on antihypertensive medz,\r\ntoday\r\nalert,oriented to TPP,BP-140/100\r\nPLAN \r\nfurther councelling\r\np.o amlodipine 5mg od\r\np.o losartan 50mg od\r\nmonitor allertness',7,'2026-09-07 07:52:35'),
(55,16,'2026-09-06 10:54:00','2026-09-06','patient admitted with alcohol abuse disorderdoing day 2 post admission,previous admission 3/12 ago,with same problem,was councelled but resumed taking alcohol a while back,defaulted on antihypertensive medz,\r\ntoday\r\nalert,oriented to TPP,BP-136/82 pr 75\r\nPLAN \r\nfurther councelling\r\nct with meds as per t sheet',7,'2026-09-07 07:56:24'),
(56,16,'2026-09-07 10:57:00','2026-09-07','DWR;DR MUIRURI,TEDDY RCO,CHRISTINE RNO \r\npatient admitted with alcohol abuse disorder doing day 3 post admission,previous admission 3/12 ago,with same problem,was councelled but resumed taking alcohol a while back,defaulted on antihypertensive medz,\r\ntoday\r\nalert,oriented to TPP,BP-136/82 pr 75\r\nPLAN \r\nfurther councelling\r\nfor discharge today\r\nto go home on,\r\np.o amlodipine 5mg 0D\r\np.o losartan 50mg OD\r\np.o olanzapine 0.5mg NOCTE\r\np.0 vitamin b complex 1 OD\r\np.o neurobion 1 OD',7,'2026-09-07 07:58:28');
