(2626,'Add Consultant Register','ipd','New Consultant Register: {doctor_name}} has been added  some instructions: patient who was brought in by relatives came in as a referral from a peripheral facility,with complains of confusion,oral thrush,dificulty in feeding,not being able to pass urine,with deviation of the lower lip,and aphaasic,patient is a known HTN patient on medication with history of hypertension and hypotension.had been on admission secondary to blood infection with no mproovement on discharge,a head ct scan was done on29/8/2026 with a conclusion of global cortical atrophy,an abdominal scan done on 26/08/2026showed hepatic steatosis grade 11,ovrely distended urinary bladder raising the possibility of urinary retention/bladder outlet obstruction,an ECG  done on 23/08/2026 showed atrial fibrillation with ashman phenomenon and controlled ventricular responce,previous hixtory of admission due to pneumonia,no history of previous  surgeries done,no history of blood transfusion.\r\npatient id a resident of gatundu with 7 siblings 1 deceased\r\nO/E-elderly,\r\nG/E-NO (pallor,cyanosis,bilateral pitting edema)\r\nVITALS-BP-100/64 PR-73,SPO2-92%\r\nR.O.S-RS-vesicular breath sounds,CVS-irregular heart rythm,CNS-GCS-13/15,ON MSS-UPPER LIMB-5/5,LOWER LIMBS-5/5,with bilateral pitting edema\r\nDX-NEWLY DIAGNOSED HYPERTENSIVE HEART DISEASE SECONDARY TO HYPERTENSION WITH LOWER LIMB EDEMA\r\nPLAN on date 29/08/2026 for the patients TERESIA KARANJA NJERI (3889) of IPD IPDN14.','',7,1,'2026-08-31 12:22:06','yes','2026-08-31 09:22:06'),
